Description: Provides TxDb (transcript database) annotations for
    plant species. The SQLite files are hosted on Zenodo
    (or other permanent URLs) and are downloaded on demand via the
    `downloadPlantTxDbs()` function. The list of available species and
    their download URLs is maintained in a curated CSV file
    (inst/extdata/metadata.csv), allowing users and contributors to
    easily add new databases without modifying R code.
